          "quote": "績寡玩好，少嗜欲，居無僕妾，躬事約儉，所有租秩，悉寄天府。及薨後，府有南康國無名錢數千萬。",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p001:m0000"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-liangshu",
          "book_id": "b-liangshu-029",
          "source_id": "s-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context-ws1538079",
          "chapter_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context",
          "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p002",
          "quote": "子會理嗣，字長才。少聰慧，好文史。年十一而孤，特爲高祖所愛，衣服禮秩與正王不殊。年十五，拜輕車將軍、湘州刺史，又領石頭戍軍事。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p002:m0001"
        }
      ],
